# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) for `pnpm dev` / `pnpm build`.

# Public VAPID key for Web Push (the private half goes to functions/.secret.local
# locally and to the VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY secret in Firebase). Without it the
# notifications panel stays hidden.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=

# Base URL of the notification backend. Default: same-origin /api (Firebase
# Hosting rewrite in production, Vite proxy to the Functions emulator in dev).
# VITE_PUSH_API_BASE=/api
